From 9f5c55064f128730c12c19234de06d7783992b30 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: misja <redacted@example.invalid>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 09:48:47 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] pinentry: support legacy and modern Assuan server APIs

Keep the legacy init/deinit and callback signatures while adapting versioned modern headers to new/release and modern registration. Emit source-qualified errors supported by both APIs. Only mark the server connected after complete registration, release failed contexts once, and return an error instead of entering the event loop after failed startup. Storage and interaction methods are retained.
